  "description": "The Hover-1 Neo I is a sleek, futuristic e-scooter at an unbeatable price. The 50 mm wide, high-strength aluminum alloy steering column offers incredible handling and stability for new riders, and the sturdy frame holds up to 160 pounds of weight. The 200W brushless motor brings Neo I to a safe and manageable 12 mph top speed, and the rechargeable battery yields 7 miles of range. Fold it down to conveniently store it at home or transport it to a scenic destination. The integrated LED display includes a speedometer, battery indicator, speed mode icons, and a headlight indicator when activated. The LED headlight and taillight help keep riders safe during low-visibility conditions, while the electronic brakes and rear drum brake brings Neo I to a complete stop quickly and safely. Neo I is also backed by a 6-month parts and labor warranty and an SGS safety certification, so parents can have peace of mind while kids enjoy the ride.",
